==English==

===Etymology===
From the distance travelled by a taxicab in a grid of streets that cross at right angles to each other.

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun|-}}

# {{lb|en|geometry}} A [[non-Euclidean geometry]] in which the [[distance]] between two [[point]]s is the [[sum]] of the [[absolute]] [[difference]]s between their corresponding [[coordinate]]s.

